00:00:05.985 --> 00:00:07.360
RYAN GREGG: My
name is Ryan Greg.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:11.728
I'm a product manager on the
serverless team and on Knative.

00:00:11.728 --> 00:00:13.020
MARK CHMARNY: I'm Mark Chmarny.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.090
I'm one of the technical
program managers looking

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.263
after serverless at Google.

00:00:16.263 --> 00:00:17.680
RYAN GREGG: Before
we get started,

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.590
I just wanted to take
a quick audience poll

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:23.780
and say, how many of
you use Kubernetes?

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:24.280
Cool.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:24.690
How many--

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:25.930
MARK CHMARNY: You're
in the right session.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:26.250
RYAN GREGG: What?

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:26.910
MARK CHMARNY: You're
in the right session.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:27.670
RYAN GREGG: Yeah, that's right.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.760
How many of you are
developers on Kubernetes?

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.424
You're writing apps that
